{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_12_level_main_12-03_beg","groupId":"main_12","stageId":"main_12-03","title":"團結就是奢望","storyCode":"12-4","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_12-03_beg.txt","sourceHash":"099449f68cb1409028927e8a3a609383776e061ac925e6359168195c6eda35e9","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"失蹤多時的伊內絲再次出現在了博士的面前，偽裝成茉莉活動的變形者集群也被Logos抓住了痕跡。諾伯特區的暴亂愈來愈無法控制了。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_G7_decisivebattlealley_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很爽快，羅德島的博士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一處安全地點的位置已經發送到了亞歷山德莉娜的終端上，請在那裡待命。我不能保證你們任何超出安排的行動的安全。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"終端？什麼時候......？!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們有幾個厲害的傢伙，這很好，這應該是達成我們共同目標的助力，而不是破壞我們合作的阻礙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"這不僅僅取決於我們。","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，我們需要慢慢建立信任。"}]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謹慎的沉默，我很欣賞。"}]},{"label":"把脅迫稱作合作是維多利亞人的傳統嗎？","value":"3","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很遺憾，是的。"}]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請等候下一次的聯絡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我需要去聯繫可露希爾，我們需要重新評估一下羅德島的通訊安全，在此之前，請保持無線電靜默。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，還有......處理本艦在維多利亞境內停留的手續問題。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊內絲小姐，謝謝你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你好，伊內絲，我們是第一次見面嗎？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恐怕不是。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我喪失了一些......記憶。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對於這次的你，是第一次見面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你真的......失憶了嗎？還是，這也是你計劃的一部分。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我確實忘記了很多事情。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"你是怎麼認為的？","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我從不輕易下判斷，Dr.{@nickname}。我能感覺到，你確實發生了一些......變化。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們之後的相處時間，還有很多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"相比於聽那些口頭上的宣言，我更傾向於自己去看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊內絲小姐，你對博士......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心吧，阿米婭，我會收好我的偏見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"暫時。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g7_subway"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救軍戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"撤離已經基本完成了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很好，我們也必須離開這裡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅本","speakerId":"avg_npc_414_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個羅德島的薩卡茲，是叫Logos嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還以為，在與Misery先生並肩作戰這麼久以後，我們都已經不會再為羅德島的作戰方式感到驚訝了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅本","speakerId":"avg_npc_414_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也對。不管那位Logos先生是什麼身份，他的那些咒術都幫了我們大忙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救軍戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......哈，而且他玩飛鏢很有一手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救軍戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我有幸跟他比過幾次，他的準頭可能和他的那些法術一樣恐怖。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_650_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我的一位朋友，教過我一些小技巧罷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_650_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那傢伙圓凳滑行賽比不過我，但玩起飛鏢來......不差。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_650_1","isRemote":false,"text":"號角女士，薩卡茲的部隊已經暫時退卻，抓緊機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"根據計劃，羅德島和自救軍會通過補給線，撤往那條運輸通道的起點，一個叫布倫特伍德的鎮子附近，並嘗試重新建立安全屋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們去那裡與他們會合。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我建議向城牆的方向突圍，諾伯特區被拋離了，薩卡茲雖然合攏了城牆，但還來不及新建一個地塊填補那裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些裸露的地下結構會幫上我們的忙的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_650_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_650_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來，我又遇到了一位故人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救軍戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是那位教飛鏢的朋友嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_650_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很遺憾，並不是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_650_1","isRemote":false,"text":"與這位故人不同，我的朋友們至死如一。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_650_1","isRemote":false,"text":"各位，我在城內恐怕還有些小事需要處理，號角女士有能力帶你們離開倫蒂尼姆。我的同事Misery也會在必要時刻支援你們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"各位，保持隱蔽，跟我來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g7_subway"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_650_1","isRemote":false,"text":"往日的山巔當真如此值得懷念？淚與血並不值得你為之著迷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“茉莉”","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我承認，我對這些並沒有如此興致盎然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“茉莉”","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但倘若，只剩下山巔可供棲身，只有榮光可得溫暖呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_650_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_650_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我以為我已經追獵了足夠多的你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“茉莉”","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"三十一個“茉莉”，你很努力，女妖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_650_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你還是得逞了，你幫助特雷西斯瓦解了自救軍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“茉莉”","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"工作而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_650_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我會撬開倫蒂尼姆的每一片瓦，找到每一個躲藏在暗處的你的碎片，變形者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_650_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你仍拒絕相信改變的可能，這從來就是你的選擇。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"變形者集群","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是不是有些太自大了，年輕的女妖？我們瞭解變化，我們自變化中而來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"變形者集群","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但變化不過是適應的手段，任何改變都有其最終的目的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"變形者集群","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在薩卡茲還未獲得如此模樣之時，我們便行走於大地之上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"變形者集群","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"理念、信仰、宗旨、口號，無一逃得過歲月的沖刷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"變形者集群","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你那些自以為新鮮的發想早有人想過，你那些自以為高尚的道途早有人踐行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"變形者集群","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們如今在哪裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"變形者集群","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們卻仍站在你的面前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"變形者集群","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這便是最好的證明。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"37_g1_glasgowboxinggym"},{"type":"narration","text":"“砰！”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“砰、砰！”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡鐸爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你該節省些體力，卡鐸爾，你吃的已經夠多的了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"戴菲恩已經反映過好幾次你的食量問題了，現在可比不得以往。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡鐸爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放輕鬆點，貝爾德，情況還沒有那麼糟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡鐸爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那幫魔族佬沒他們看起來的那麼強大，他們只是打了我們一個措手不及。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡鐸爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"運輸工會的馬歇爾找我聊過一次，他們那裡也團結了一批人。只要我們再多拉些人入夥，那幫薩卡茲也並非不可戰勝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡鐸爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就像以前我們幾個幫派團結起來對付那些條子們一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡鐸爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"背後突襲，乾淨俐落，“咻咻”，“啪”！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡鐸爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幾拳放倒，就這麼簡單。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薩卡茲的軍隊可不是條子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡鐸爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，他們很厲害。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡鐸爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我們不怕流血，不怕犧牲！我們會越過倒下的同胞，再把拳頭狠狠砸在他們的臉上——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡鐸爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就像拳館的名字，“揍歪下巴”！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡鐸爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我和馬歇爾盤算過了，我們絕對能贏！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"和你收藏的那些龍門劣質錄製影片裡一樣，嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡鐸爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是認真的，我在諾伯特區街頭摸爬滾打的時間比你短不了多少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡鐸爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們得為自己謀一條出路，就像以前一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡鐸爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們的那位推進之王當時就這麼離開了格拉斯哥幫，我們那些地盤都拱手讓給了別人，是你和我想盡辦法重新在這裡站穩了腳跟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡鐸爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在無非像以前一樣，團結起來，做好準備，然後揍翻他們，反正我們一直是這麼過來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡鐸爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不管外面情況怎樣，街頭總有街頭的辦法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡鐸爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接下來，只要尋找到一個時機......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來戴菲恩他們回來了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡鐸爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"禿頭佩爾鬆口了嗎？就算是眼下的情況，我們給的價格也相當高，他應該——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡鐸爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了？這是......血？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"禿頭佩爾死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡鐸爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡鐸爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薩卡茲——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"膽怯的市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不是薩卡茲！該死的，我不知道那些都是誰，我們到那家店的時候就已經打起來了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"膽怯的市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"他們殺紅了眼！我親眼看到有個拿撬棍的傢伙，把另一個人按在地上，那傢伙甚至——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"膽怯的市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"嘔——咳咳咳！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"情況很糟，大概是哪個餓瘋了的流浪漢盯上了佩爾的店，那蠢貨還把麵包放在玻璃櫥窗裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"結果可想而知。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你可以猜猜，現在這一片被封鎖的街區裡，這種“流浪漢”有多少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡鐸爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡鐸爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些該死的瘋子，大概是什麼違禁品把他們的腦子燒壞了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我認識那個拿撬棍的傢伙，是個賣尾巴毛髮護理膏的推銷員，平時臉上總掛著笑容。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我買過幾次他的產品，他給我打了折，不過談不上好用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剛才......我看見他雙眼通紅，嘴角淌著血，那把撬棍已經被他砸得變了形。我幾乎......認不出他來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恐慌在蔓延，卡鐸爾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡鐸爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——運輸工會的人說過這種情況，他們說可能有些膽小鬼會發瘋，可是怎麼......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抵住門！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"膽怯的市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"我，我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還愣著幹什麼，快點來幫忙！卡鐸爾，去把沙發推過來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡鐸爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"混蛋，你們找死嗎？你們*維多利亞粗口*想幹嘛？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"門外的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡鐸爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"滾開，這裡還*維多利亞粗口*有活人呢，這裡是格拉斯哥幫的地盤！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"門外的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡鐸爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"貝爾德，小心！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一柄消防斧將拳館厚重的門板劈開一道縫隙，鋒利的斧刃擦著貝爾德的髮梢而過。\n幾根髮絲飄落。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡鐸爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我說了，這裡還*維多利亞粗口*有活人呢！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"卡鐸爾抵住門，兩隻手緊緊攥住穿過門板的斧刃，門外的人試了幾次，都沒有成功把斧子重新抽出。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡鐸爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不管你是誰，給我滾！否則我會把這把斧頭嵌進你的腦袋裡！我說到做到！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"門外的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"斧子又搖晃了幾下，幾次沉重的踹門聲過後，門外的人終於放棄了努力，紛亂的腳步聲逐漸遠去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"膽怯的市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"你手上......你的手指......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡鐸爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡鐸爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝天謝地，拳館最不缺的就是繃帶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡鐸爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"貝爾德，戴菲恩，我們得重新清點一遍所有物資。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡鐸爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我去卸幾個沙袋下來，重新加固一下大門。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"膽怯的市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"這......這些人，他們難道都瘋了嗎？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"膽怯的市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"他們......諾伯特區本該都是有道德的市民，基本上......警察呢？他們平時開罰單比誰都勤快！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡鐸爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要是個沒來得及溜出地塊的倒楣條子，現在一定揣好武器把自己鎖在家裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡鐸爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......之後我得再去運輸工會一趟，馬歇爾的話住在這裡的人們總還是認的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡鐸爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他——大家平常都願意聽他的，他能想出辦法來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡鐸爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"該死......該死！薩卡茲還在外面，這幫人昏了頭，怎麼能——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"膽怯的市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"我們......接下來怎麼辦？卡鐸爾之前說，只要等......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一個機會？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“下個院士”先生，你知道十五年前諾伯特區的那場大火嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"膽怯的市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，我聽說過，好像是在碼頭......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"燒掉整個碼頭並沒有什麼困難的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"熱得要死的天氣，堆滿刨花的庫房，和一顆沒掐滅的煙頭，就足以釀成那一切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這種火，沒人能撲得滅的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們只能眼睜睜看著一切都燒成灰燼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
